# Socket exclusions — retired on 2 Oct 2026.
#
# This file used to exclude tests/fixtures/audits/security.mjs, a never-
# executed test fixture that the skills.sh Socket scanner flagged as a
# dangerous sink. The exclusion was never shown to be honoured, and the
# scanner pattern-matched the fixture's string literals regardless. Since
# 1.6.1 the fixture does not exist in the repository at all: it is generated
# at test runtime by tests/lib/make-security-fixture.mjs (which assembles its
# sink texts from fragments, so no contiguous sink sequence exists in the
# tracked tree), and the audit suites prove the profile still detects both
# sinks in the generated file. The exclusion is retired; there is nothing
# left to exclude.
